tents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "enpe8n3le01ob07re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "enpe8n3le01ob07re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "<b>Presenter</b>: Are you working on a project, but you seem to have problems planning and organizing your work? </br>\n<b>Client</b>: Yes, ma'am. </br>\n<b>Presenter</b>: Here's the answer! Organize your project using a Gantt chart! </br>\nWe can use Gantt charts to organize the tasks for a project's schedule, they include the starting point and the deadline of the tasks. Gantt charts consist of a bar chart expressing the work breakdown structure of a project. This is to say that a Gantt chart organizes every single task required to achieve the goal of a project in a diagram. In the past, Gantt charts only summarized the elements of a project, while modern charts show the expected time for a task to finish; the optimistic, realistic, and pessimistic due time; the relation among tasks and their progress in percentages."}, {"time": "46000", "image": "enpe8n3le01ob07re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<b>Client</b>: Great! Where did it come from? </br>\n<b>Presenter</b>: The Gantt chart was actually designed by the polish economist Karol Adamiecki in 1896. He called his chart harmonogram, and became very famous in Poland and Russia, but due to the language, the chart only became famous in other countries when the American Henry Gantt created his own version in the 1910's; his chart was the evolution of Adamiecki's harmonogram. Nowadays, Gantt charts are a common charting technique, but when they first appeared, people considered them revolutionary."}, {"time": "79000", "image": "enpe8n3le01ob07re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<b>Client</b>: I'm definitely using a Gantt chart for my next project! </br>\n<b>Presenter</b>: I'm positive that Gantt charts are helping many businesses and people plan a number of tasks. You can surely use this tool to organize collected data and to schedule tasks for a project. If you were not able to organize activities in a given period of time, you can definitely do so now and also control the development of tasks and the progress of a project with the Gantt chart. It's very useful for information management. </br>\nGet your Gantt chart now and accomplish your projects successfully and on time!"}], "coverimg": "enpe8n3le01ob07re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0}]}